vdcnX_s5K9WpUyGZXP2xR13S1042mRrvTiHAmHD_0HR_JzVWXHpDHsb1o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af1akfMnex5-tG4eNF7r77XPEKQjDYo9dGW9wzOh0XkKBg&oe=69F0CEE8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1116681196788883", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982477_1116681200122216_6236613464184975156_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vu7Ge18uVwAQ7kNvwEfquV0&_nc_oc=AdocGPiApoCWwsbZ_X1TY3SwGxxDR2ZuE8AZ7MGQbAsh7alZjlAPJxH5NhaGbD48cIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0ATyZGSWhIVTvZgkbGjcY2tvLCpLcA3d1hIC931oqGPA&oe=69F0B316"}, "display_name": "SprintAR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SprintAR is an Augmented Reality training app.\n\nIt lays out different patterns of training cones for sprinting, football, soccer or basketball. Automatically records lap times and shows a **ghost replay for you to chase!**\n\n- Never measure out training cones (witches hats) ever again!\n- Never have to collect them back up again, either :)\n- Includes many different cone patterns (no need to research them)\n\n# For personal trainers and coaches\n\n- Impress students with the latest technology\n- When running, students see a guide where to go next\n- Forces students to go round cones properly\n- Optionally use soccer balls or basketballs\n- Designed to quickly hand off the headset from one student to the next\n\n# For students\n\n- Chase a ghost of the best time!\n- See your time instantly\n- Practice multiple patterns, in the same space, with no setup time\n\n**SAFETY WARNING: never expose the inside of your VR headset (where the lenses are) to direct sunlight**\n", "short_description": "Layout different patterns of training cones in Augmented Reality. Automatically record lap times and show a ghost replay for you to chase!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kennardconsulting.com/sprintar/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_ser